WEBVTT

00:05:00.171 --> 00:05:04.383
But it's completely unlike us
in every other way.

00:05:06.469 --> 00:05:07.678
So you might be thinking,

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:08.929
"OK, dark matter.

00:05:08.971 --> 00:05:11.057
It clearly has a color
associated with it."

00:05:11.057 --> 00:05:13.059
It's dark, like my pants.

00:05:14.268 --> 00:05:15.686
Right?

00:05:15.728 --> 00:05:18.272
But the first thing you should know
about dark matter

00:05:18.272 --> 00:05:19.857
is that it doesn't have a color,

00:05:19.857 --> 00:05:21.650
and at least at first approximation,

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:24.904
light seems to go right through it,
so we can't see it.

00:05:24.904 --> 00:05:28.282
It's invisible, maybe
transparent, maybe clear.

00:05:28.866 --> 00:05:30.743
So if you put out your hands